.* SAVE: the task menu for saving.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='SAVE'.
:IMPORT NAME=QSMNSAVE PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=SAV PNLGRP=QHSRCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=SAVCFG PNLGRP=QHSRCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=SAVCHGOBJ PNLGRP=QHSRCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=SAVLIB PNLGRP=QHSRCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=SAVLICPGM PNLGRP=QHSZCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=SAVOBJ PNLGRP=QHSRCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=SAVSECDTA PNLGRP=QHSRCMD.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System Main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=SAVE HELP=HLPSAVE KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Save
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUGRP.Save Data
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD ?SAVOBJ OBJTYPE(*FILE)' HELP=SAVOBJ.Files
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?SAVLIB' HELP=SAVLIB.Libraries
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD ?SAVDLO' HELP='SAVE/OPT3'.Documents and folders
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD ?SAVOBJ OBJTYPE(*PGM)' HELP=SAVOBJ.Programs
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD ?SAVOBJ' HELP=SAVOBJ.Other objects
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD ?SAVCHGOBJ' HELP=SAVCHGOBJ.Changed objects only
:MENUI OPTION=7 ACTION='CMD ?SAVLICPGM' HELP=SAVLICPGM.Licensed programs
:MENUI OPTION=8 ACTION='CMD ?SAVSECDTA' HELP=SAVSECDTA.Security data
:MENUI OPTION=10 ACTION='CMD ?SAVCFG' HELP=SAVCFG.Configuration
:MENUI OPTION=11 ACTION='CMD ?SAV' HELP=SAV.Objects in directories
:EMENUGRP.
:MENUGRP.Save System and User Data
:MENUI OPTION=20 ACTION='CMD QSMNSAVE OPTION(20)' HELP=QSMNSAVE.Define save system and user data defaults
:MENUI OPTION=21 ACTION='CMD QSMNSAVE OPTION(21)' HELP=QSMNSAVE.Entire system
:MENUI OPTION=22 ACTION='CMD QSMNSAVE OPTION(22)' HELP=QSMNSAVE.System data only
:MENUI OPTION=23 ACTION='CMD QSMNSAVE OPTION(23)' HELP=QSMNSAVE.All user data
:EMENUGRP.
:MENUGRP.Save Document Library Objects
:MENUI OPTION=30 ACTION='CMD ?SAVDLO DLO(*ALL)' HELP='SAVE/OPT30'.All documents, folders, and mail
:MENUI OPTION=31 ACTION='CMD ?SAVDLO DLO(*CHG)' HELP='SAVE/OPT31'.New and changed documents, new folders, all mail
:MENUI OPTION=32 ACTION='CMD ?SAVDLO' HELP='SAVE/OPT32'.Documents and folders
:MENUI OPTION=33 ACTION='CMD ?SAVDLO DLO(*MAIL)' HELP='SAVE/OPT33'.Mail only
:MENUI OPTION=34 ACTION='CMD ?SAVDLO'.
:EMENUGRP.
:MENUGRP.Save Libraries
:MENUI OPTION=40 ACTION='CMD ?SAVLIB LIB(*NONSYS)' HELP=SAVLIB.All libraries other than system library
:MENUI OPTION=41 ACTION='CMD ?SAVLIB LIB(*IBM)' HELP=SAVLIB.All IBM libraries other than system library
:MENUI OPTION=42 ACTION='CMD ?SAVLIB LIB(*ALLUSR)' HELP=SAVLIB.All user libraries
:MENUI OPTION=43 ACTION='CMD ?SAVCHGOBJ OBJ(*ALL) LIB(*ALLUSR)' HELP=SAVCHGOBJ.All changed objects in user libraries
:EMENUGRP.
:MENUGRP.Save for Different Systems
:MENUI OPTION=50 ACTION='MENU SAVS36FMT' HELP='SAVE/OPT50'.Save in System/36 format
:EMENUGRP.
:MENUGRP.Related Commands
:MENUI OPTION=70 ACTION='MENU CMDSAV' HELP='SAVE/OPT70'.Related commands
:EMENUGRP.
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPSAVE.Save - Help
:P.Copying objects to media so they can be restored later, one kind at a
time or the whole system. Prompted options show what will be saved
before it starts.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F13=Information Assistant
:PD.Shows menu INFO.
:PT.F16=System Main menu
:PD.Shows menu MAIN.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SAVE/OPT3'.Documents and folders
:P.Option 3. Runs the SAVDLO command&colon. Documents and folders.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SAVE/OPT30'.All documents, folders, and mail
:P.Option 30. Runs SAVDLO DLO(*ALL)&colon. All documents, folders, and
mail.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SAVE/OPT31'.New and changed documents, new folders, all mail
:P.Option 31. Runs SAVDLO DLO(*CHG)&colon. New and changed documents,
new folders, all mail.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SAVE/OPT32'.Documents and folders
:P.Option 32. Runs the SAVDLO command&colon. Documents and folders.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SAVE/OPT33'.Mail only
:P.Option 33. Runs SAVDLO DLO(*MAIL)&colon. Mail only.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SAVE/OPT50'.Save in System/36 format
:P.Option 50. Shows menu SAVS36FMT&colon. Save in System/36 format.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SAVE/OPT70'.Related commands
:P.Option 70. Shows menu CMDSAV&colon. Related commands.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
